<title>USA: USDA 7-State and U.S. Cattle on Feed.</title>
<headline>USDA 7-State and U.S. Cattle on Feed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA cattle on feed, 1,000-plus head feedlots (data in 1,000 head):</p>
<p>    7 MAJOR STATES --  Pct----1997-----1996     1995</p>
<p> On Feed Aug 1	   119   7,556    6,337    7,391</p>
<p>During July:</p>
<p> -Placed on Feed	 118   1,751    1,483    1,404</p>
<p> -Marketed		 109   1,832    1,678    1,698</p>
<p> -Other Disappearance   91	42	 46	 49</p>
<p> On Feed July 1	  117   7,679    6,578    7,734</p>
<p>The seven major states are Arizona, California, Colorado, Iowa, Kansas, Nebraska and Texas.  </p>
<p>USDA cattle on feed in the United States (1,000-plus head feedlots, data in 1,000 head):</p>
<p>    U.S. TOTAL --	Pct----1997-----1996</p>
<p> On Feed Aug 1	   116   8,790    7,546</p>
<p>During July:</p>
<p> -Placed on Feed	 114   1,995    1,746</p>
<p> -Marketed		 106   2,106    1,978</p>
<p> -Other Disappearance   92	57	 62</p>
<p> On Feed July 1	  114   8,958    7,840</p>
<p>Traders had expected lower 7-state figures -- 116 pct for on feed, 101 pct for July placements and 106 pct for marketings.</p>
</text>
